    {
      "title": "Jantar Mantar protest against CEC: Traffic diversions to be enforced at 30 key points on October 10",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Delhi/jantar-mantar-protest-against-cec-traffic-diversions-to-be-enforced-at-30-key-points-on-october-10/article71565796.ece",
